        </dc:subject>
        <dc:title>Epitaxial Synthesis of Highly Oriented 2D Janus Rashba Semiconductor BiTeCl and BiTeBr Layers</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>The family of layered BiTeX (X = Cl, Br, I) compounds are intrinsic Janus semiconductors with giant Rashba-splitting and many exotic surface and bulk physical properties. To date, studies on these materials required mechanical exfoliation from bulk crystals which yielded thick sheets in nonscalable sizes. Here, we report epitaxial synthesis of Janus BiTeCl and BiTeBr sheets through a nanoconversion technique that can produce few triple layers of Rashba semiconductors (&lt;10 nm) on sapphire substrates. The process starts with van der Waals epitaxy of Bi2Te3 sheets on sapphire and converts these sheets to BiTeCl or BiTeBr layers at high temperatures in the presence of chemically reactive BiCl3/BiBr3 inorganic vapor. Systematic Raman, XRD, SEM, EDX, and other studies show that highly crystalline BiTeCl and BiTeBr sheets can be produced on demand. Atomic level growth mechanism is also proposed and discussed to oﬀer further insights into growth process steps. Overall, this work marks the direct deposition of 2D Janus Rashba materials and oﬀers pathways to synthesize other Janus compounds belonging to MXY family members.</dcterms:abstract>
        <dc:date>2020-11-24</dc:date>
        <z:language>en</z:language>
        <z:libraryCatalog>DOI.org (Crossref)</z:libraryCatalog>
        <dc:identifier>
            <dcterms:URI>
                <rdf:value>https://pubs.acs.org/doi/10.1021/acsnano.0c06434</rdf:value>
            </dcterms:URI>
        </dc:identifier>
        <dcterms:dateSubmitted>2026-01-10 14:31:30</dcterms:dateSubmitted>
        <dc:rights>https://doi.org/10.15223/policy-029</dc:rights>
        <dc:description>论文摘要：层状BiTeX（X = Cl, Br, I）化合物家族是本征Janus半导体材料，具有巨大的Rashba分裂效应及诸多奇异的表面与体相物理特性。目前对该类材料的研究依赖于从块体晶体机械剥离，所得厚片尺寸受限且难以规模化。本文报道通过纳米转化技术在蓝宝石衬底上外延合成Janus型BiTeCl与BiTeBr薄层（&lt;10 nm，约数个三元层厚度）。该工艺始于蓝宝石上Bi2Te3层的范德华外延生长，随后在高温下通过BiCl3/BiBr3无机蒸气化学反应将其转化为BiTeCl或BiTeBr层。系统的拉曼光谱、X射线衍射、扫描电镜、能量色散X射线光谱等表征表明，可按需制备高结晶度的BiTeCl与BiTeBr薄层。本文进一步提出并讨论了原子尺度的生长机理，以深入阐释生长过程步骤。本研究实现了二维Janus Rashba材料的直接沉积，并为合成MXY家族其他Janus化合物提供了可行路径。
titleTranslation: 高度取向二维Janus Rashba半导体BiTeCl与BiTeBr层的外延合成
TLDR: This work reports epitaxial synthesis of Janus BiTeCl and BiTeBr sheets through a nanoconversion technique that can produce few triple layers of Rashba semiconductors on sapphire substrates and offers pathways to synthesize other Janus compounds belonging to MXY family members.</dc:description>
        <bib:pages>15626-15632</bib:pages>
    </bib:Article>
